{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08819","headline":"题雍丘崔明府丹竈 · 李白","name":"题雍丘崔明府丹竈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"美人爲政本忘机，服药求仙事不违。\n叶县已泥丹竈毕，瀛洲当伴赤松归。\n先师有诀神将助，大圣无心火自飞。\n九转但能生羽翼，双凫忽去定何依。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08819.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08819","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}